{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22069","headline":"新乐府 涧底松\t念寒儁也 · 白居易","name":"新乐府 涧底松\t念寒儁也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有松百尺大十围，生在涧底寒且卑。\n涧深山险人路绝，老死不逢工度之。\n天子明堂欠梁木，此求彼有两不知。\n谁喻苍苍造物意，但与之材不与地。\n金张世禄原宪贫，牛衣寒贱貂蝉贵。\n貂蝉与牛衣，高下虽有殊。\n高者未必贤，下者未必愚。\n君不见沈沈海底生珊瑚，历历天上种白榆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22069.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22069","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}